{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14846","headline":"和赵给事白蝇拂歌 · 卢纶","name":"和赵给事白蝇拂歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华堂多衆珍，白拂称殊异。\n柄裁沈节香袭人，上结爲文下垂穗。\n霜缕霏微莹且柔，虎须乍细龙髯稠。\n皎然素色不因染，淅尔凉风非爲秋。\n羣蝇青苍恣游息，广庖万品无颜色。\n金屏成点玉成瑕，昼眠宛转空咨嗟。\n此时满筵看一举，荻花忽旋杨花舞。\n砉如寒隼惊暮禽，飒若繁埃得轻雨。\n主人说是故人留，每诫如新比白头。\n若将挥玩闲临水，愿接波中一白鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}